OL,3,GNEWSAThe simple home test that could be
OL,4,A'amazing' for bladder cancer patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrevor Field knows how uncomfortable
OL,7,Ftests for bladder cancer can be.
OL,9,FIn the 13 years since the 81-year-old
OL,10,Fwas diagnosed, he has had more
OL,11,Fcystoscopies than he can count.
OL,13,FThe procedure involves inserting a
OL,14,Fcamera into the bladder and he has to
OL,15,Fhave these every six to 12 months, to
OL,16,Fmake sure his cancer has not returned.
OL,18,FBut he could eventually benefit from a
OL,19,Fsimple urine test at home instead:
OL,20,F"That would be tremendous."
